FasterSwiper — Copyright mgbowen — Apache License, Version 2.0
https://github.com/mgbowen/FasterSwiper

The macOS 27 CGEvent/IOHID serialization approach originates here: macOS 27
stopped acting on synthetic dock-swipe events unless they carry a serialized
IOHID payload in CGEvent field 4205, which must be spliced in via
CGEventCreateData() / CGEventCreateFromData(). mgbowen documented the wire
format publicly and implemented it in FasterSwiper (branch macos27).

src/event_serialize.c is a C reimplementation of that approach by geesawra
(github.com/geesawra/InstantSpaceSwitcher, commit 79a17c4), retaining
FasterSwiper's data model and type names (IOHIDFluidTouchGestureData,
IOHIDVelocityEventData, IOHIDSystemQueueElement*). It was published without
attribution in an MIT-licensed fork; this project attributes it to
FasterSwiper and includes the Apache-2.0 license accordingly.

