MODIFICATIONS made by this project to the vendored sources
(stated per Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)):

src/ISS.c
  - Removed the macOS 27 gesture sign inversion in iss_post_dock_swipe().
    Upstream inverts progress and velocity on the augmented path. On the
    test machine this made the posted gesture move opposite to ISS's own
    internal direction model, so iss_should_block_switch() guarded the
    wrong edge and BOTH directions failed at the leftmost space.
  - Added ~10ms pacing between the Began/Changed/Ended gesture phases,
    backported from InstantSpaceSwitcher PR #88.

src/issd.c
  - New file. Replaces upstream's one-shot ISSCli with a resident daemon.
    See README.md ("Why a daemon") for why this is required.
  - Invalidates ISS's prediction cache when a press is not part of a rapid
    burst, or when the space list changed. Upstream never invalidates it,
    so any externally-caused space change makes it refuse moves. See
    README.md ("The prediction cache").

tools/spacejump.m
  - New file. Read-only diagnostic, not part of the switching path.
